Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||11-24-1999||06:07 PM||||A couple years ago I was talking with an ex-g/f and she said her dad bought a new car or something, and gave her his "Ferrerio" for her 16th birthday. I asked her "do you mean Fiero??"<BR>she said "yeah, I think so!" so of course I said "cool!!"<BR>turns out her dad used to race it, and it was a modified silver 86 GT.. I don't remember what mods it had, but it was faster than stock. Never got to see it tho.||||reg||1
Z||000006||88 Fiero||11-25-1999||10:44 AM||||Fiero's are really special car...I've never get enough attention with other people... Even if it's not painted yet...with that special wing mounted,  a different taillights, air dam in the front, mecham scoops, turbo side scoops, exhaust tips and 17 inch wheels...I get alot of attention and sometimes they are trying to figure out what kind of a car is it...But everyone turns around when I step on the gas...It was loud and mean.....||||reg||1
